Subject: Cantor Self Work Update Broker B1 CDrive Production Broker P0 Justification

@ [justification_uuid] 4530f1bc-6493-40a1-9415-6867f38f3d62
@ [canonical_uuid] 0fb58a71-348c-4df3-83bc-33989c826f26

& [Need]
  + a deterministic plan is not a process-owning host and cannot enforce lease consumption descendant termination or retained failure truth
  + ordinary process spawn followed by job assignment leaves a race before containment
  + direct-child termination and synthetic commission forms cannot support a trustworthy self-work attempt

& [SmallestCorrectMove]
  + form one broker contract joining the five already identified authority gaps and one race-free Windows contained-child primitive
  + preallocate lease ledger and evidence roles so runtime durability and attribution do not depend on cleanup or directory creation
  + keep the execution permit private and implementation authority distinct from physical activation

& [ProductValue]
  + Cantor gains the executable control seam needed to host a bounded local agent process under explicit accountability
  + exact job accounting retained receipts and no-retry quarantine support later independent review signing persistence and activation
  + read-scope P1 can become a real host experiment without weakening provider or Windows policy

& [Boundary]
  + no physical commission lease ledger process App Server writer provider model MCP network publication persistence activation cleanup D-drive WSL or foreign effect
